[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "qg-declined-main 2...e6"]
[Name "3.cxd5: the Exchange at once"]

3. cxd5
3... exd5 { Always take back with the pawn in this structure. It keeps a pawn on d5 and frees the c8 bishop. 3...Qxd5 brings the queen out too soon, and 4.Nc3 gains a move on her. }
4. Nc3 Nf6 { The Exchange Variation, by another order. } *
